EDWORDDE.DIC, EDWORDES.DIC, EDWORDFR.DIC and EDWORDIT.DIC
===============================================================================

These word lists were made from the hunspell dictionaries as packaged at
https://github.com/wooorm/dictionaries (German: igerman98 by Björn Jacke;
Spanish: the LibreOffice es_ES dictionary, RLA-ES project; French: the
Grammalecte dictionaries by Olivier R.; Italian: the Italian Writing Aids by
Andrea Pescetti and others). Each stem is kept with the forms of it that
occur in the wordfreq frequency lists (https://github.com/rspeer/wordfreq,
data CC BY-SA 4.0):

    tools/mkhun.py index.aff index.dic large_de.msgpack.gz > words.txt
    mkdic words.txt EDWORDDE.DIC         (Italian: top 100000 forms)

Each is distributed under its own licence, given in full below:
German GPL-2.0 or GPL-3.0; Spanish GPL-3.0, LGPL-3.0 or MPL-1.1;
French MPL-2.0; Italian GPL-3.0.

